## Schema

### Required

- `category` (Number) Key of the vergeio_tag_category this tag belongs to. Use tonumber(vergeio_tag_category.example.id). Changing category replaces the tag, because VergeOS does not move a tag between categories.
- `name` (String) Tag name.

### Optional

- `description` (String) Tag description. Omit to leave an existing description unchanged.

### Read-Only

- `category_name` (String) Name of the tag category, read from VergeOS. Refreshed when this tag is applied, including after the category is renamed.
- `id` (String) Tag key assigned by VergeOS.

## Import

Import is supported using the tag key.

```shell
terraform import vergeio_tag.example <id>
```
